---
source: crates/pitboard/src/main.rs
expression: every_usage_error()
---
$ pitboard list
error: unrecognized subcommand 'list'

Usage: pitboard [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

For more information, try '--help'.
$ pitboard lst
error: unrecognized subcommand 'lst'

  tip: a similar subcommand exists: 'stow'

Usage: pitboard [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

For more information, try '--help'.
$ pitboard stat
error: unrecognized subcommand 'stat'

  tip: some similar subcommands exist: 'statusline', 'status'

Usage: pitboard [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

For more information, try '--help'.
$ pitboard doctr
error: unrecognized subcommand 'doctr'

  tip: some similar subcommands exist: 'adopt', 'doctor'

Usage: pitboard [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

For more information, try '--help'.
$ pitboard use
error: the following required arguments were not provided:
  <LABEL>

Usage: pitboard use <LABEL>

For more information, try '--help'.
$ pitboard --jsno
error: unexpected argument '--jsno' found

  tip: a similar argument exists: '--json'

Usage: pitboard --json

For more information, try '--help'.
$ pitboard status --verbose
error: unexpected argument '--verbose' found

Usage: pitboard status [OPTIONS]

For more information, try '--help'.
$ pitboard watch install --at 40
error: invalid value '40' for '--at <PERCENT>': 40 is not in 50..=99

For more information, try '--help'.
$ pitboard watch install --once
error: unexpected argument '--once' found

Usage: pitboard watch install [OPTIONS]

For more information, try '--help'.
$ pitboard completions foo
error: invalid value 'foo' for '<SHELL>'
  [possible values: bash, elvish, fish, powershell, zsh]

For more information, try '--help'.
$ pitboard use work extra
error: unexpected argument 'extra' found

Usage: pitboard use [OPTIONS] <LABEL>

For more information, try '--help'.
$ pitboard log -n x
error: invalid value 'x' for '--lines <LINES>': invalid digit found in string

For more information, try '--help'.
